# BUGS

There are no `FILE` streams, `atexit`, `<threads.h>` or locales yet (6e2c), and no C++ (6e2d).

Programs built against the sysroot are not yet checked by `./build check`'s analyzer and clang-tidy, and nothing yet compares the configuration file with the Swift toolchain's patched clang (6e2b2).
